<article class="env-exercise" id="029G">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/029G">Exercise <span data-tag="029G">111.35.4</span>.</a> For any field $K$ prove that the diagram </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \xymatrix{ \mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}(K) \ar[r] \ar[d] &  \mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}(K[\epsilon _1]) \ar[d] \\  \mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}(K[\epsilon _2]) \ar[r] &  \mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}(K[\epsilon _1, \epsilon _2]/(\epsilon _1\epsilon _2)) }  \]
</div>
  <p> is a pushout diagram in the category of schemes. (Here $\epsilon _ i^2 = 0$ as before.) </p>
</article>